flowchart LR
    merge([Merge to main]) --> build[Build and test]
    build --> passed{Tests pass?}
    passed -- No --> notify[Notify the author]
    passed -- Yes --> canary[Canary at 5%]
    canary --> healthy{Errors under 1%?}
    healthy -- No --> rollback[Roll back]
    rollback --> notify
    healthy -- Yes --> full[Roll out to 100%]
    full --> done([Release complete])
    notify --> stopped([Release stopped])
